{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Horror Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 3rd-person survival horror action game across 3 story-driven acts, offering tens of hours of gameplay with two difficulty modes to choose from.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Inventory Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With scarce resources and tight inventory space, every decision matters - making every bullet count can mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Garment Crafting &amp; Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repairing and crafting garments isn\u2019t just cosmetic - it\u2019s essential to survival, adding a unique strategic layer to the horror experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadly Hide-and-Seek</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Act 2, face a special challenge where brute force won\u2019t work. Outsmart towering bosses in tense hide-and-seek encounters, relying on sharp judgment and quick decisions to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966070?t=1757242019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/627d5e1fe6716d5ca7882484e88d66942c373981/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757242019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/1243fd608afa7f6d5f77a8468519b7cd93be8580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757242019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966070/1243fd608afa7f6d5f77a8468519b7cd93be8580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757242019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc